                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. A plan that covers a person as an active employee or dependent of an active employee is primary. The plan that covers a person as a retired, laid-off, or other inactive employee or as a dependent of a retired, laid-off, or other inactive employee is secondary.",
